WEBVTT

00:01:46.760 --> 00:01:47.660
Wha?

00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:50.770
Where am I?

00:01:57.640 --> 00:01:59.570
Asagiri Junko?!

00:02:00.690 --> 00:02:03.620
This is a dream! After all, she was...

00:02:05.580 --> 00:02:07.120
<i>How are we feeling?!</i>

00:02:07.170 --> 00:02:09.280
What the hell're you doing?

00:02:09.280 --> 00:02:12.460
<i>Oh, can't you tell? I'm a nurse!</i>

00:02:12.680 --> 00:02:14.620
That's not what I mean...

00:02:14.620 --> 00:02:18.970
Wasn't the Oasis secret service
torturing you beyond imagination?!

00:02:18.970 --> 00:02:21.470
<i>Oh, you were worried about me?!</i>

00:02:21.950 --> 00:02:23.180
<i>I got a new job!</i>

00:02:23.660 --> 00:02:24.680
<i>In the RHG!</i>

00:02:24.680 --> 00:02:25.660
Huh?!

00:02:27.650 --> 00:02:30.020
<i>Seems you hit your head when you tripped.</i>

00:02:30.440 --> 00:02:32.480
<i>Be a nice boy for a little while longer!</i>

00:02:32.970 --> 00:02:34.800
<i>Well, I'll be back later!</i>

00:02:37.880 --> 00:02:43.280
Yep, I'm dreamin'. That broad'd
never take a job helping others...

00:02:43.820 --> 00:02:47.040
Could this be the afterlife?

00:02:47.040 --> 00:02:50.840
Maybe she was tortured to death
and became a nurse after reforming!

00:02:53.710 --> 00:02:54.800
Still...

00:02:55.550 --> 00:02:57.660
What's the RHG?

00:03:02.850 --> 00:03:03.840
Yo.

00:03:03.840 --> 00:03:05.710
What's with the outfit?

00:03:07.100 --> 00:03:10.420
<i>That busty broad told me
to wear it 'cause it suits me.</i>

00:03:09.720 --> 00:03:11.770
<i>"Koizumi Taiko - 14 Years Old"</i>

00:03:12.380 --> 00:03:14.860
<i>That's all there is to wear!</i>

00:03:20.100 --> 00:03:22.180
So it wasn't a dream?

00:03:22.180 --> 00:03:25.500
<i>Seems this is a secret base
for Natsuko-san and the others,</i>

00:03:25.500 --> 00:03:30.160
<i>but the food's great and they even
let me bathe, so I'm enjoying it!</i>

00:03:30.710 --> 00:03:32.400
So it is in the Oasis?

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:33.310
<i>Yes.</i>

00:03:33.310 --> 00:03:38.920
<i>It's in a corner much deeper than
the cave the government's using.</i>

00:03:34.850 --> 00:03:37.110
<i>RHG HQ</i>

00:03:34.850 --> 00:03:37.110
<i>Maze Area</i>

00:03:41.180 --> 00:03:43.220
<i>What do you suppose will happen now?</i>

00:03:43.560 --> 00:03:46.520
No point in broodin' over it now.

00:03:46.520 --> 00:03:49.200
I'm just gonna eat my fill and sleep!

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:51.480
<i>You certainly have some guts.</i>

00:03:57.740 --> 00:04:00.120
Y-you're!

00:04:03.770 --> 00:04:05.570
So itchy!

00:04:05.570 --> 00:04:06.470
<i>What's wrong?!</i>

00:04:06.470 --> 00:04:09.480
<i>This always happens when
he deals with pure people...</i>

00:04:09.480 --> 00:04:13.000
Y-you're that runaway Oasis soldier!

00:04:13.300 --> 00:04:17.000
The pure-hearted bastard who helps
the weak by crushing the strong...

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:19.350
...Kaido Masaru!

00:04:19.350 --> 00:04:21.010
<i>Long time, no see!</i>

00:04:21.290 --> 00:04:24.360
<i>Umm... Weren't you sold to a homo?</i>

00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:26.220
<i>I definitely had a real tough time.</i>

00:04:27.140 --> 00:04:31.810
<i>But the Oasis had been monitoring me,
so I was rescued before long.</i>

00:04:32.990 --> 00:04:36.020
Spoiled kids are spoiled kids,
wherever they go.

00:04:36.820 --> 00:04:37.730
<i>That's for sure.</i>

00:04:37.730 --> 00:04:40.440
<i>I deeply apologize for my carelessness...</i>

00:04:40.710 --> 00:04:43.880
That voice!
The Chinoike Archaeology Team's...

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:47.800
<i>- Dark Age historian, lkeda.</i>

00:04:47.800 --> 00:04:54.750
<i>In truth, we weren't going to persuade
you after considering your nature...</i>

00:04:55.130 --> 00:04:57.450
<i>But after the Uzumaki Chemicals incident,</i>

00:04:57.450 --> 00:05:00.420
<i>word got out that the Sunabouzu
had been betrayed by the government</i>

00:05:00.860 --> 00:05:03.630
<i>and so he moved on his own.</i>

00:05:03.630 --> 00:05:05.380
<i>I'm very sorry.</i>

00:05:05.380 --> 00:05:07.490
<i>I'm sure you've heard by now,</i>

00:05:07.490 --> 00:05:12.180
<i>but we, the RHG, would like
to have the Sunabouzu join us!</i>

00:05:12.560 --> 00:05:13.650
- RHG?

00:05:12.560 --> 00:05:13.650
<i>- RHG?</i>

00:05:14.490 --> 00:05:18.950
<i>Another handyman guild that secretly
upholds the future and freedom</i>

00:05:18.950 --> 00:05:21.310
<i>of the denizens of
the Great Kanto Desert!</i>

00:05:21.310 --> 00:05:22.610
<i>The Reverse Handyman Guild!</i>

00:05:23.030 --> 00:05:24.030
<i>Abbreviated as...</i>

00:05:24.650 --> 00:05:25.920
<i>...RHG!</i>

00:05:26.950 --> 00:05:31.770
<i>As it operates now, the Oasis
government cannot help the unfortunate!</i>

00:05:31.770 --> 00:05:35.120
<i>"If they can't do it, then we will!"</i>

00:05:35.120 --> 00:05:40.170
<i>Officials and civilians have gathered
around this idea to form the RHG!</i>

00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:42.900
<i>Sunabouzu-kun! Stand with us!</i>

00:05:42.900 --> 00:05:45.630
<i>Yes! It's your duty to join us!</i>

00:05:45.890 --> 00:05:49.530
<i>Sunabouzu-kun! We know you don't
like how the government works!</i>

00:05:49.530 --> 00:05:51.430
<i>I don't either, to be honest!</i>

00:05:51.430 --> 00:05:53.490
<i>Neither do I, of course!</i>

00:05:53.490 --> 00:05:56.890
<i>The RHG is a congregation of
people who feel the same as you!</i>

00:05:56.890 --> 00:06:01.090
<i>Sunabouzu-kun! Wouldn't you like
to help us win our freedom?!</i>

00:06:01.090 --> 00:06:03.380
<i>Yes! It should make your own work...</i>

00:06:03.380 --> 00:06:05.670
Quit decidin' things for me.

00:06:06.790 --> 00:06:11.280
I don't think the current
Oasis government is all that bad.

00:06:12.430 --> 00:06:17.000
Yes, it has done some sucky stuff,
but I like it for the most part.

00:06:17.490 --> 00:06:19.000
Food and medicine.

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:23.760
The government supplies the bare
essentials to survive in the desert.

00:06:23.760 --> 00:06:26.390
But that's it.

00:06:26.390 --> 00:06:30.070
They keep you alive,
but don't do any more than that.

00:06:30.070 --> 00:06:33.390
"You're on your own if you
don't wanna die", is how they act.

00:06:34.230 --> 00:06:35.310
I like that.

00:06:35.770 --> 00:06:39.720
<i>Actually, there's someone big
who highly values you...</i>

00:06:39.720 --> 00:06:41.100
Someone big?

00:06:41.560 --> 00:06:44.330
<i>The RHG guildhead.</i>

00:06:44.330 --> 00:06:45.320
Guildhead?

00:06:45.480 --> 00:06:46.470
<i>Me!</i>

00:06:46.470 --> 00:06:48.040
You?!

00:06:51.570 --> 00:06:55.610
<i>S-such intensity! Such stifling tension!</i>

00:06:56.160 --> 00:06:57.450
<i>But it's no wonder.</i>

00:06:57.960 --> 00:07:00.960
<i>The Great Kanto Desert's
two oddest men,</i>

00:07:00.960 --> 00:07:03.630
<i>pervert fiend and master skinflint...</i>

00:07:03.630 --> 00:07:06.130
<i>are staring it out in this tiny room!</i>

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:11.570
<i>The master skinflint is president
of the Game of Life Company</i>

00:07:11.570 --> 00:07:14.370
<i>and greatest treasure hunter
in all the desert...</i>

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:16.430
<i>...Kaizuka Kaoru!</i>

00:07:17.540 --> 00:07:20.160
<i>You came too, little one!</i>

00:07:20.160 --> 00:07:22.270
<i>What's with that outfit?</i>

00:07:22.910 --> 00:07:24.060
<i>It's good to see you.</i>

00:07:24.660 --> 00:07:25.230
So!

00:07:26.100 --> 00:07:32.130
You threw Kaido, Natsuko, and the
rest out to tell me what, exactly?

00:07:32.130 --> 00:07:34.490
If you'd just sell your game
like a good old man,

00:07:34.910 --> 00:07:37.800
you could live what's
left of your life in peace...

00:07:38.770 --> 00:07:42.030
<i>Seems you're as twisted as ever.</i>

00:07:42.030 --> 00:07:44.200
Whatever do you mean?

00:07:44.200 --> 00:07:51.340
I fall far short of a cold-blooded
jerkoff who pulls innocent people

00:07:51.680 --> 00:07:55.000
into selfish bastards'
sappy-ass fairy tales.

00:08:02.350 --> 00:08:03.950
<i>You're one to talk.</i>

00:08:05.010 --> 00:08:08.690
<i>Are you sure you're not happy
this chance actually came up?</i>

00:08:16.830 --> 00:08:18.080
<i>It's that look again.</i>

00:08:19.820 --> 00:08:22.830
<i>It's true I want to talk to you.</i>

00:08:23.430 --> 00:08:27.200
<i>I deliberately became their palanquin.</i>

00:08:27.200 --> 00:08:30.160
<i>You're going to carry me, too.</i>

00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:33.840
I thought you were gonna
call for me in 10 years, though...

00:08:34.170 --> 00:08:36.890
<i>There is no longer time
to be so laid-back.</i>

00:08:37.130 --> 00:08:39.890
<i>I'm sure you've realized it, too.</i>

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:44.390
<i>The Great Kanto Desert is starting
to overflow with dangerous power.</i>

00:08:44.680 --> 00:08:46.660
Those monsters?

00:08:47.860 --> 00:08:49.790
<i>Not just them.</i>

00:08:49.790 --> 00:08:54.320
<i>I assume you haven't forgotten
about the guardian at the skeleton city?</i>

00:08:54.980 --> 00:08:55.950
Hell no.

00:08:57.120 --> 00:09:00.490
<i>People originally gathered
in the Great Kanto Desert</i>

00:09:00.930 --> 00:09:04.060
<i>because Dark Age artifacts
would turn up here.</i>

00:09:06.110 --> 00:09:11.170
<i>But lately, the things dug up
have been getting newer and newer.</i>

00:09:11.170 --> 00:09:14.490
<i>And they've all been dangerous
super-science objects.</i>

00:09:15.720 --> 00:09:18.180
<i>Super-science... Super-science...</i>

00:09:18.530 --> 00:09:22.430
I get it. You worked your ass off
getting ahold of him

00:09:22.430 --> 00:09:25.690
so you could take on the government...

00:09:26.380 --> 00:09:29.960
You sure you just don't wanna
take over for the Oasis?!

00:09:29.960 --> 00:09:31.740
<i>I won't deny it!</i>

00:09:35.390 --> 00:09:38.350
<i>What exactly could they be discussing?</i>

00:09:38.350 --> 00:09:42.660
<i>Given those two,
it can't be anything good.</i>

00:09:42.990 --> 00:09:47.040
<i>Why would someone of
Kaizuka-san's standing want him?</i>

00:09:47.820 --> 00:09:51.710
<i>I doubt you'll ever understand!</i>

00:09:58.890 --> 00:10:03.170
<i>During the Dark Age, a worldwide
environmental cataclysm occurred,</i>

00:10:03.170 --> 00:10:05.460
<i>and the Kanto became a desert.</i>

00:10:05.460 --> 00:10:07.780
<i>The Earth's nature lost its balance,</i>

00:10:07.780 --> 00:10:13.360
<i>but it's said to be slowly returning
to its normal state on its own.</i>

00:10:13.700 --> 00:10:18.130
Lost its balance, huh?
What's "normal" mean?

00:10:18.130 --> 00:10:22.120
<i>That it will be an easier environment
for life to live in.</i>

00:10:22.120 --> 00:10:26.600
<i>But the Oasis government
intends to do nothing to help it.</i>

00:10:26.600 --> 00:10:31.730
Guess nobody'd need the Oasis anymore
if that ever happened...

00:10:31.730 --> 00:10:35.770
<i>It's said that it'll take the planet
millennia or even dozens of millennia</i>

00:10:35.770 --> 00:10:39.180
<i>to return to normal on its own.</i>

00:10:40.110 --> 00:10:41.410
Talk about patient.

00:10:41.410 --> 00:10:44.640
So, what do you intend to do?

00:10:44.640 --> 00:10:50.650
<i>I'm not collecting Dark Age technology
just to topple the government.</i>

00:10:51.120 --> 00:10:55.880
<i>I'm going to artificially speed up
the process and afforest the Earth.</i>

00:10:55.880 --> 00:10:58.370
<i>A
f
f
o
r
e
s
t
</i>

00:10:56.370 --> 00:10:57.610
<i>Afforest?</i>

00:11:02.640 --> 00:11:04.530
That ain't what I'm askin'.

00:11:04.840 --> 00:11:07.540
What are you gonna make me do?!

00:11:10.210 --> 00:11:13.040
<i>Maze Area</i>

00:11:13.040 --> 00:11:15.660
<i>WEST</i>

00:11:15.880 --> 00:11:19.050
<i>YDNAH</i>

00:11:17.030 --> 00:11:19.050
<i>Wow, "Reverse Handymen"...</i>

00:11:19.440 --> 00:11:21.550
<i>I-it's so cool!</i>

00:11:21.550 --> 00:11:26.200
<i>You guys ain't ordinary handymen
no more. Pull yourselves together.</i>

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:27.770
<i>Yeah! Act cool!</i>

00:11:27.760 --> 00:11:33.150
<i>R
e
v
e
r
s
e
</i>

00:11:27.760 --> 00:11:33.150
<i>H
a
n
d
y
m
a
n
</i>

00:11:28.100 --> 00:11:33.150
<i>F-Fuyu-niichan! Look, look!
I'm completely "RHG" now, too!</i>

00:11:33.280 --> 00:11:34.400
<i>When did you...</i>

00:11:34.400 --> 00:11:37.990
<i>Guy's suddenly more
rarin' to go than we are!</i>

00:11:37.990 --> 00:11:40.550
<i>I can get serious too, when I have to!</i>

00:11:42.900 --> 00:11:44.740
<i>W-what is it, Bro?</i>

00:11:44.740 --> 00:11:46.120
<i>Somethin' there?</i>

00:11:46.580 --> 00:11:49.420
<i>No... Must be my imagination...</i>

00:12:02.600 --> 00:12:04.380
We've reached an agreement!

00:12:05.010 --> 00:12:06.760
<i>The old man says he's hungry...</i>

00:12:06.760 --> 00:12:08.060
<i>Yes! Right away!</i>

00:12:08.660 --> 00:12:11.460
<i>So, what did you agree to?</i>

00:12:11.460 --> 00:12:12.910
I'll help you.

00:12:14.150 --> 00:12:16.020
<i>To what do we owe this surprise?</i>

00:12:16.230 --> 00:12:20.930
I'll be killed if I say no.
I'll be killed if I run.

00:12:20.930 --> 00:12:24.030
So my only choice is to join you...

00:12:24.400 --> 00:12:25.530
<i>You're plannin' something.</i>

00:12:25.910 --> 00:12:27.410
Just something lucrative...

00:12:27.690 --> 00:12:29.370
<i>How do we know you won't betray us?</i>

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:33.120
You won't trust me
no matter what I do, anyway.

00:12:33.900 --> 00:12:35.420
<i>That's true.</i>

00:12:35.830 --> 00:12:38.670
<i>We're counting on you, Sunabouzu!</i>

00:12:48.830 --> 00:12:50.280
<i>Yahoo!</i>

00:12:51.240 --> 00:12:53.600
<i>It's yummy, yummy lunch time!</i>

00:12:53.960 --> 00:12:57.220
<i>Eat lots and regain your strength!</i>

00:12:57.220 --> 00:12:58.900
<i>OK! Say ah!</i>

00:13:01.640 --> 00:13:02.940
<i>Come on!</i>

00:13:02.950 --> 00:13:04.360
<i>Ah!</i>

00:13:08.460 --> 00:13:09.280
<i>C'mon...</i>

00:13:10.640 --> 00:13:12.240
<i>What's the matter?</i>

00:13:33.290 --> 00:13:37.150
<i>H-he's handling me
like I weigh nothin'!</i>

00:13:37.150 --> 00:13:38.270
<i>Damn you!</i>

00:13:41.130 --> 00:13:41.650
<i>Howdya like that?!</i>

00:13:43.840 --> 00:13:44.440
<i>W-what?!</i>

00:13:48.270 --> 00:13:50.570
<i>Gotta tell... Natsuko...</i>

00:13:52.040 --> 00:13:53.330
<i>Guests?!</i>

00:13:53.330 --> 00:13:54.580
<i>I'll greet them!</i>

00:13:55.930 --> 00:13:57.320
<i>Master!</i>

00:13:57.320 --> 00:13:59.920
<i>Look, look! New model equipment!</i>

00:13:59.920 --> 00:14:01.850
<i>Wow! It's so light!</i>

00:14:01.850 --> 00:14:03.690
<i>Master! Master!</i>

00:14:04.860 --> 00:14:07.170
Here I come! I'm gonna get ya!

00:14:07.170 --> 00:14:11.510
<i>No! I only let rich people catch me!</i>

00:14:12.880 --> 00:14:17.320
The RHG's gonna pay me
whatever I want! Lemme catch you!

00:14:17.320 --> 00:14:18.700
<i>In that case, go ahead!</i>

00:14:18.700 --> 00:14:21.450
<i>Oh! 10,000 yen a feel, you know!</i>

00:14:21.450 --> 00:14:23.360
<i>You're the same as ever, Sunabouzu.</i>

00:14:25.070 --> 00:14:26.550
Tanigawa Seiji-kun!

00:14:26.550 --> 00:14:27.530
<i>Heya.</i>

00:14:28.110 --> 00:14:29.700
<i>You stalker!</i>

00:14:29.700 --> 00:14:32.640
<i>N-no! The RHG's ideals intrigued me!</i>

00:14:32.640 --> 00:14:35.000
Who cares about that.

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:37.500
Don't tell me those are our suits?

00:14:37.500 --> 00:14:38.500
<i>Yep!</i>

00:14:38.500 --> 00:14:40.450
<i>They look the same on the outside,</i>

00:14:40.450 --> 00:14:43.620
<i>but they're the same as the
Fisheye Specials on the inside!</i>

00:14:43.620 --> 00:14:45.270
<i>More advanced, in fact!</i>

00:14:45.270 --> 00:14:46.710
<i>Try it out!</i>

00:14:47.020 --> 00:14:49.130
<i>If you need test partners,
there's some out front!</i>

00:14:49.130 --> 00:14:50.550
The guys from before?

00:14:50.880 --> 00:14:53.540
<i>Probably. Can you handle 'em for us?</i>

00:14:54.490 --> 00:14:57.060
Like I really got a choice here.

00:14:57.460 --> 00:14:58.310
<i>Thanks.</i>

00:14:58.940 --> 00:15:02.920
<i>I'm going to evacuate Kaizuka-san.
Asagiri and Tanigawa, come too!</i>

00:15:02.920 --> 00:15:03.790
<i>Right!</i>

00:15:03.790 --> 00:15:05.000
<i>Hold on!</i>

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:06.260
<i>Later, Kan-chan!</i>

00:15:09.310 --> 00:15:11.900
<i>How did Kaizuka-san's evacuation go?!</i>

00:15:11.900 --> 00:15:13.120
<i>All OK here!</i>

00:15:13.740 --> 00:15:16.550
<i>Then head to the underground parking lot!</i>

00:15:16.550 --> 00:15:17.790
<i>We'll be there soon!</i>

00:15:31.260 --> 00:15:33.090
<i>Damn monster!</i>

00:15:41.530 --> 00:15:44.610
<i>Keep your hands off of Natsuko!</i>

00:15:45.710 --> 00:15:47.570
<i>Fuyu-niisan! Aki-niisan!</i>

00:15:55.420 --> 00:15:56.910
<i>Haruo!</i>

00:16:01.300 --> 00:16:02.870
<i>So easy to move in!</i>

00:16:03.260 --> 00:16:04.560
Taiko.

00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:05.080
<i>Yes?</i>

00:16:17.650 --> 00:16:19.310
Koizumi Taiko-kun!

00:16:19.310 --> 00:16:22.480
As of this moment,
your training is complete!

00:16:22.480 --> 00:16:26.610
Congratulations! You are
now a full-fledged handyman!

00:16:32.940 --> 00:16:33.820
<i>Self-Dependence</i>

00:16:33.820 --> 00:16:36.320
<i>Yay! Yay! Yay!</i>

00:16:37.040 --> 00:16:40.750
So the enemies out front are all yours.

00:16:41.510 --> 00:16:44.970
<i>Eh? W-what are you going to do?</i>

00:16:44.970 --> 00:16:49.500
Use your head. This is a
secret anti-government base.

00:16:49.500 --> 00:16:53.210
They're not gonna throw everything
they got at the front door.

00:16:53.210 --> 00:16:56.470
While Natsuko and the rest are
handling them, the real attack'll come...

00:16:57.100 --> 00:16:58.330
...from the rear.

00:16:58.330 --> 00:16:59.720
<i>Then you're going to...</i>

00:17:00.420 --> 00:17:05.190
The last thing the old man said...
do you know what it meant?

00:17:05.780 --> 00:17:10.370
<i>Once the Oasis is gone, it'll take
some time until my plan bears fruit.</i>

00:17:10.370 --> 00:17:14.350
<i>Current society will need to survive
until then.</i>

00:17:12.760 --> 00:17:17.150
<i>Say goodnight</i>

00:17:14.350 --> 00:17:16.550
<i>That, I will manage.</i>

00:17:16.550 --> 00:17:17.910
<i>However...</i>

00:17:17.150 --> 00:17:21.000
<i>Embraced by the scorching sand</i>

00:17:18.990 --> 00:17:21.700
<i>After that, comes you guys' work.</i>

00:17:21.000 --> 00:17:27.080
<i>Say goodnight</i>

00:17:22.070 --> 00:17:25.170
The old man said he's
about to take a shit

00:17:25.170 --> 00:17:28.510
and that he wants us
to wipe his ass for him.

00:17:28.510 --> 00:17:29.460
<i>Eh?!</i>

00:17:29.460 --> 00:17:31.090
I don't like any of it.

00:17:31.090 --> 00:17:35.550
The old man, Kaido,
Natsuko... RHG? Get real.

00:17:33.500 --> 00:17:37.590
<i>Say goodnight</i>

00:17:36.180 --> 00:17:37.590
<i>Master...</i>

00:17:37.590 --> 00:17:41.880
<i>With your hopes dashed</i>

00:17:38.140 --> 00:17:44.600
We're handymen. We don't work
for ideas and principles like them.

00:17:41.880 --> 00:17:46.960
<i>Say goodnight</i>

00:17:45.590 --> 00:17:51.270
Let's show those "Reverse Handymen"
what real handymen do!

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:51.440
<i>You're a warrior</i>

00:17:51.430 --> 00:17:52.320
<i>Right!</i>

00:17:51.440 --> 00:18:08.780
<i>But go to sleep like an infant now</i>

00:17:52.590 --> 00:17:57.030
The front'll be tough enough.
I leave it to you, Handyman Kosuna!

00:17:57.870 --> 00:17:59.380
<i>Handyman Kosuna?</i>

00:18:00.550 --> 00:18:01.700
Alright! Let's do it!

00:18:01.970 --> 00:18:03.200
<i>Yes, sir!</i>

00:18:03.510 --> 00:18:07.070
<i>Alright! Here I come!</i>

00:18:21.360 --> 00:18:25.000
<i>Say goodnight</i>

00:18:21.960 --> 00:18:24.100
<i>A robot soldier?!</i>

00:18:24.530 --> 00:18:25.680
<i>Sergeant Kawaguchi!</i>

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:29.300
<i>Lay your exhausted body down</i>

00:18:26.700 --> 00:18:28.190
<i>Into the truck! Hurry!</i>

00:18:29.470 --> 00:18:36.210
<i>Say goodnight</i>

00:18:37.560 --> 00:18:38.780
<i>Step on it!</i>

00:18:41.680 --> 00:18:45.850
<i>Say goodnight</i>

00:18:45.850 --> 00:18:49.920
<i>You threw out your things long ago</i>

00:18:47.690 --> 00:18:49.040
<i>Bastard!</i>

00:18:49.920 --> 00:18:55.360
<i>You don't have one thing left</i>

00:18:55.360 --> 00:18:59.900
<i>Everyone will realize it</i>

00:18:55.860 --> 00:18:57.260
<i>Commander located.</i>

00:18:57.260 --> 00:19:00.240
<i>Excellent! That's not just the commander!</i>

00:18:59.900 --> 00:19:06.810
<i>So from tomorrow on,</i>

00:19:00.240 --> 00:19:01.470
<i>It's Kaizuka Kaoru!</i>

00:19:01.740 --> 00:19:05.180
<i>So the Game of Life president
is the faction's don!</i>

00:19:05.760 --> 00:19:06.720
<i>Ayukawa!</i>

00:19:06.720 --> 00:19:15.480
<i>Forget everything and go to sleep</i>

00:19:06.720 --> 00:19:09.740
<i>That's him, all right!
Capture him at all costs!</i>

00:19:09.740 --> 00:19:11.190
<i>Understood.</i>

00:19:15.740 --> 00:19:24.460
<i>You beat withered arms with whips</i>

00:19:15.740 --> 00:19:17.730
<i>H-help!</i>

00:19:19.570 --> 00:19:20.740
<i>Incoming!</i>

00:19:24.460 --> 00:19:32.570
<i>and drink up the blood of fallen prey</i>

00:19:28.090 --> 00:19:28.870
<i>Good job!</i>

00:19:32.570 --> 00:19:43.940
<i>because this world
is always a battleground</i>

00:19:34.440 --> 00:19:35.420
<i>Taiko-chan...</i>

00:19:35.420 --> 00:19:38.920
<i>Natsuko-san! Get me outta here!</i>

00:19:45.900 --> 00:19:48.940
<i>Hey, Ayukawa! What happened?! Hey!</i>

00:19:48.940 --> 00:19:50.520
<i>W-wait!</i>

00:19:50.990 --> 00:19:53.380
<i>Way to go, Kosuna!</i>

00:19:54.700 --> 00:19:56.660
<i>You're somethin' else!</i>

00:19:56.660 --> 00:19:58.230
<i>Well, I am a handyman!</i>

00:19:58.920 --> 00:20:00.280
<i>What happened to Kanta?</i>

00:20:02.510 --> 00:20:06.700
<i>Master said he was going to
show everyone what real handymen do...</i>

00:20:08.100 --> 00:20:09.330
<i>So he ran away.</i>

00:20:11.950 --> 00:20:15.920
<i>M-Master saw that the real
attack would come from behind!</i>

00:20:16.360 --> 00:20:18.420
<i>He said he'd handle them by himself!</i>

00:20:18.950 --> 00:20:21.180
<i>That's a real handyman!</i>

00:20:21.180 --> 00:20:29.390
<i>Buried in the sand, you close your eyes</i>

00:20:21.180 --> 00:20:23.180
<i>Master did not run away!</i>

00:20:23.780 --> 00:20:27.680
Yikes... Did they really
attack from this way?

00:20:28.150 --> 00:20:31.560
Here I was hoping to use 'em all
as a big decoy to escape!

00:20:29.390 --> 00:20:40.400
<i>With your memory in a far-off dream</i>

00:20:32.370 --> 00:20:35.270
It's a lie turned true...

00:20:37.590 --> 00:20:38.820
<i>Master is...</i>

00:20:39.770 --> 00:20:40.780
<i>Master is!</i>

00:20:40.400 --> 00:20:49.380
<i>The frozen earth, the end of a journey</i>

00:20:41.300 --> 00:20:42.470
<i>Kan-chan...</i>

00:20:49.380 --> 00:20:56.890
<i>The yesterday and today in which
you lived so single-mindedly</i>

00:20:56.890 --> 00:21:06.130
<i>and the dawn your constant screams
can't reach all recede away</i>

00:21:06.130 --> 00:21:13.930
<i>Your trembling fingertips
are soaked in blood</i>

00:21:13.930 --> 00:21:25.510
<i>because this world is
always a battleground</i>

00:21:17.370 --> 00:21:20.360
<i>No... way...</i>

00:21:24.940 --> 00:21:30.000
<i>Rearward forces eliminated.
Mission accomplished.</i>

00:21:29.180 --> 00:21:37.560
<i>Now halt your walking, halt your breathing</i>

00:21:30.340 --> 00:21:34.710
<i>Never mind the small-fries!
Go help Ayukawa!</i>

00:21:34.710 --> 00:21:36.220
<i>Understood.</i>

00:21:37.560 --> 00:21:44.380
<i>and say goodnight</i>

00:21:45.460 --> 00:21:53.540
<i>For eternity... For eternity...</i>

00:21:49.840 --> 00:21:50.870
Kosuna...

00:21:53.830 --> 00:21:55.100
<i>Master...</i>

00:21:55.460 --> 00:21:57.940
<i>I'm going to help my master!</i>

00:21:58.900 --> 00:22:00.150
<i>Stop, Kosuna!</i>

00:22:00.310 --> 00:22:01.850
<i>Let go of me!</i>

00:22:01.850 --> 00:22:03.730
<i>Master is... Master is!</i>

00:22:13.340 --> 00:22:15.240
<i>Kanta, he...</i>

00:22:17.380 --> 00:22:19.960
<i>M-Master!</i>

00:23:55.040 --> 00:23:56.810
<i>Well, it's been a fun ride!</i>

00:23:56.810 --> 00:23:59.710
<i>I've enjoyed playing
Ghost of the Desert, Sunabouzu!</i>

00:23:59.710 --> 00:24:01.820
<i>Unfortunately, my role ends
with today's show,</i>

00:24:01.820 --> 00:24:04.230
<i>but I hope to see you all
again in another...</i>

00:24:04.230 --> 00:24:05.620
<i>Um, Director? Is this for real?</i>

00:24:05.620 --> 00:24:07.900
<i>So next episode is
"Master and Pupil, Part 2"!</i>

00:24:07.900 --> 00:24:10.380
<i>Miss it and it'll make no scents!</i>
